    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you navigate the deadly course and secure a high score in this precision platformer / coin runner game? Invert gravity and jump to explore your way through a gauntlet of hazards collecting coins and big bonuses. Three modes of play available.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undying</strong> - Explore 10 sections losing 1/3 score when you hit hazards. Greed your way through the course to earn a place on the leader board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merciless</strong> - An endless mode where hazards remove health. Get too greedy and your run is cut short. Difficulty also increases as you progress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun</strong> - A 4-5 minute run where picking up coins speeds you up and jumping slows you slightly. Compete for the best time through the course.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/10fb58db119f718e8cd08c6c899d98db.poster.avif?t=1747320378\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/10fb58db119f718e8cd08c6c899d98db.webm?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/10fb58db119f718e8cd08c6c899d98db.mp4?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to fill the combo meter on the left. Once full take your choice of 3 rewards to enhance the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/db8075cd69d28a4d52d0c621ea752536.poster.avif?t=1747320378\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/db8075cd69d28a4d52d0c621ea752536.webm?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/db8075cd69d28a4d52d0c621ea752536.mp4?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate faster and faster as you collect coins. Use gravity shift as often as possible because jumping will slow you down. Hitting hazards resets your speed entirely.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you navigate the deadly course and secure a high score in this precision platformer / coin runner game? Invert gravity and jump to explore your way through a gauntlet of hazards collecting coins and big bonuses. Three modes of play available.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undying</strong> - Explore 10 sections losing 1/3 score when you hit hazards. Greed your way through the course to earn a place on the leader board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merciless</strong> - An endless mode where hazards remove health. Get too greedy and your run is cut short. Difficulty also increases as you progress.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun</strong> - A 4-5 minute run where picking up coins speeds you up and jumping slows you slightly. Compete for the best time through the course.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/10fb58db119f718e8cd08c6c899d98db.poster.avif?t=1747320378\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/10fb58db119f718e8cd08c6c899d98db.webm?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/10fb58db119f718e8cd08c6c899d98db.mp4?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to fill the combo meter on the left. Once full take your choice of 3 rewards to enhance the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/db8075cd69d28a4d52d0c621ea752536.poster.avif?t=1747320378\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/db8075cd69d28a4d52d0c621ea752536.webm?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039650/extras/db8075cd69d28a4d52d0c621ea752536.mp4?t=1747320378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate faster and faster as you collect coins. Use gravity shift as often as possible because jumping will slow you down. Hitting hazards resets your speed entirely.</p>",
